WEBVTT

01:29.530 --> 01:32.979
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.550 --> 01:36.110
[Episode 1]

02:09.720 --> 02:10.680
Master.

02:49.030 --> 02:50.730
[One month earlier...]

02:51.760 --> 02:53.500
You're the only one who can't keep up.

02:53.500 --> 02:55.310
I went to great lengths

02:55.600 --> 02:57.860
to hide among these death row prisoners,

02:58.020 --> 02:59.920
just to enter Lingya Tower

03:00.120 --> 03:02.760
and find the antidote for my mother.

03:03.240 --> 03:05.930
Master said Lingya Tower
is extremely well hidden.

03:05.930 --> 03:07.720
Lingya Tower has 8 levels,

03:07.750 --> 03:09.590
each guarded by a voice-keeper

03:09.640 --> 03:11.450
who leads a group of mute servants.

03:11.450 --> 03:13.600
The voice-keepers organize death matches,

03:13.600 --> 03:15.520
forcing female prisoners
to fight one another to the death

03:15.520 --> 03:17.920
for the entertainment of wealthy elites.

03:17.980 --> 03:19.240
They treat human lives as worthless

03:19.240 --> 03:20.840
and have no shred of conscience left.

03:20.840 --> 03:22.079
For my mother,

03:22.640 --> 03:26.020
I must enter this living hell
no matter what.

03:36.070 --> 03:36.990
Food is here.

03:50.160 --> 03:51.390
How are we supposed to eat this?

03:51.390 --> 03:52.500
It's gone bad.

04:01.850 --> 04:02.910
What do you mean?

04:04.350 --> 04:05.410
Say something!

04:05.450 --> 04:07.240
He's a mute servant. He can't speak.

04:07.240 --> 04:08.720
He means

04:08.740 --> 04:09.830
that by the time it's our turn,

04:09.830 --> 04:11.080
this is all that'll be left for us.

04:11.080 --> 04:12.130
What do you mean this is all that's left

04:12.130 --> 04:13.520
by the time it's our turn?

04:13.520 --> 04:14.320
Why is that?

04:14.480 --> 04:15.520
Food

04:15.520 --> 04:16.760
is distributed

04:16.779 --> 04:17.899
from top to bottom here.

04:17.899 --> 04:19.220
Those at the top

04:19.220 --> 04:20.740
always get to pick first.

04:33.550 --> 04:34.820
Then how do we
get to the upper levels?

04:34.820 --> 04:36.020
Each level of Lingya Tower

04:36.020 --> 04:37.659
has a death match.

04:37.810 --> 04:39.340
The prisoners here fight,

04:39.340 --> 04:41.070
wagering their lives on it.

04:41.200 --> 04:42.580
If you win,

04:42.580 --> 04:44.100
you move up a level.

04:44.460 --> 04:46.080
If you reach the top,

04:46.140 --> 04:48.140
you may win your freedom.

04:48.580 --> 04:50.420
But if you lose,

04:51.820 --> 04:54.100
you die.

04:54.740 --> 04:56.400
Gambling with your life, huh?

04:56.700 --> 04:58.580
If I want to join this death match,

04:59.020 --> 04:59.940
what should I do?

04:59.940 --> 05:01.500
Then you'd better find a way

05:01.500 --> 05:03.300
to meet the voice-keeper first.

05:03.860 --> 05:05.780
How do I meet the voice-keeper then?

05:05.780 --> 05:08.510
Unless you go looking for death,
it won't happen.

05:21.100 --> 05:22.900
-Are you alright?
-Are you okay?

05:33.720 --> 05:36.159
[Zhuang Wujiu, Level 1 Voice-keeper]

05:40.620 --> 05:41.840
In Lingya Tower,

05:41.860 --> 05:43.370
suicide is the gravest taboo.

05:43.370 --> 05:44.970
Hasn't anyone told you that?

05:45.510 --> 05:46.330
Speak.

05:47.100 --> 05:48.460
What are you plotting?

05:49.060 --> 05:52.300
I want to take part in the death match.

05:53.810 --> 05:55.090
It's been a long time

05:55.110 --> 05:57.040
since I saw someone so eager to die.

06:02.820 --> 06:04.420
If you're looking for death,

06:04.460 --> 06:06.100
I'll grant your wish.

06:11.900 --> 06:12.620
Go.

06:12.120 --> 06:14.940
[Death Match]

06:12.870 --> 06:14.220
Report to the Tower Master.

06:14.220 --> 06:17.380
A death match will be held
on the lowest level.

06:27.480 --> 06:28.280
Don't take it.

06:29.410 --> 06:30.350
Whoever takes it

06:30.380 --> 06:31.980
has to enter the death match.

06:32.000 --> 06:33.730
-A death match?
-A death match?

06:45.650 --> 06:47.450
If we're going to starve anyway,

06:47.850 --> 06:49.850
we might as well fight for our lives.

06:51.150 --> 06:51.990
-Yeah.
-Right.

06:51.990 --> 06:53.100
We might as well take our chances.

06:53.100 --> 06:54.010
Yes. Better to risk our lives

06:54.010 --> 06:55.260
than starve to death.

06:55.260 --> 06:56.300
Don't eat it.

06:56.300 --> 06:57.980
Don't eat it.

07:15.060 --> 07:16.020
Dear honored guests,

07:16.020 --> 07:18.350
an additional match will
be held on the lowest level tonight.

07:18.350 --> 07:19.340
I wonder

07:19.340 --> 07:20.760
if you'd be interested.

07:20.780 --> 07:22.460
What kind of match is it this time?

07:22.460 --> 07:23.740
Yes, how does it work?

07:23.740 --> 07:26.000
How many female prisoners have arrived?

07:27.420 --> 07:29.520
[Level 1: Eight-Trigrams Death Match]

07:41.100 --> 07:44.260
Welcome, everyone,
to the Eight-Trigrams Death Match.

07:44.680 --> 07:46.330
You have 10 drumbeats.

07:46.610 --> 07:48.060
Only those who find the Gate of Life

07:47.390 --> 07:50.480
[Qian] [Kun] [Zhen] [Xun]
[Kan] [Li] [Gen] [Dui]

07:48.060 --> 07:49.659
may leave

07:49.659 --> 07:50.730
and advance to the next level.

07:50.730 --> 07:52.170
Let the death match

07:52.200 --> 07:53.280
begin.

08:14.050 --> 08:15.580
You nearly scared me to death.

08:15.580 --> 08:17.320
I thought you were
one of the mute servants.

08:17.320 --> 08:18.350
Did you find…

08:56.490 --> 08:57.250
Yanzhi.

09:02.540 --> 09:03.780
It's me.

09:07.690 --> 09:09.490
I saw so many people die

09:09.520 --> 09:11.240
on my way here.

09:13.940 --> 09:14.540
This

09:14.780 --> 09:16.420
drumbeat is deafening.

09:16.450 --> 09:17.970
It's terrifying.

09:17.990 --> 09:19.390
That's the 2nd drumbeat.

09:19.620 --> 09:20.380
If we don't find the exit

09:20.380 --> 09:21.420
before the 10th drumbeat,

09:21.420 --> 09:22.480
we'll all die here.

09:23.170 --> 09:23.890
Huh?

09:26.380 --> 09:27.100
Yanzhi.

09:27.810 --> 09:28.730
Yanzhi.

09:29.050 --> 09:30.350
I don't want to die.

09:44.350 --> 09:45.150
This way.

09:50.380 --> 09:51.380
An exit?

10:02.580 --> 10:03.850
This isn't the real exit.

10:03.850 --> 10:05.030
It's not real?

11:30.570 --> 11:31.250
Man,

11:31.670 --> 11:32.650
how many drumbeats have there been?

11:32.650 --> 11:34.170
If I remember correctly,

11:34.590 --> 11:36.020
it should be the 6th drumbeat.

11:36.020 --> 11:37.330
We're running out of time.

11:37.330 --> 11:39.190
We need to find the real exit fast.

11:39.350 --> 11:40.310
Alright.

11:40.410 --> 11:41.610
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

11:46.810 --> 11:47.810
How was it?

11:47.840 --> 11:49.850
Dear honored guests,

11:49.880 --> 11:51.100
are you satisfied with your picks?

11:51.100 --> 11:52.030
I bet on 5 people,

11:52.050 --> 11:52.870
and 4 of them died.

11:52.870 --> 11:53.740
Damn, that's bad luck.

11:53.740 --> 11:55.000
Play a few more rounds,

11:55.100 --> 11:56.950
and you'll get the hang of it.

12:21.170 --> 12:22.370
Hurry.

12:32.520 --> 12:34.150
That's the 7th drumbeat already.

12:34.150 --> 12:34.900
Three more,

12:34.900 --> 12:36.440
and we're done for, aren't we?

12:36.440 --> 12:39.840
With so many doors, when are we
supposed to find the right one?

12:45.960 --> 12:47.140
The note.

12:49.320 --> 12:53.510
[Qian] [Kun] [Zhen] [Xun]
[Kan] [Li] [Gen] [Dui]

12:52.840 --> 12:54.960
This map shows eight doors in total.

12:55.470 --> 12:57.270
We've already checked 6 of them.

12:57.400 --> 13:02.480
[Qian] [Kun] [Zhen] [Xun]
[Kan] [Li] [Gen] [Dui]

12:57.780 --> 12:58.750
My guess is

12:58.770 --> 13:00.020
that the Gate of Life lies

13:00.020 --> 13:02.340
in either the Qian or Dui direction.

13:02.860 --> 13:03.740
We're running out of time—

13:03.740 --> 13:04.860
we have to split up

13:04.860 --> 13:06.520
if we want a chance to survive.

13:08.520 --> 13:09.310
Alright,

13:09.330 --> 13:10.590
you take this door.

13:10.610 --> 13:12.340
I'll go over there.

13:12.340 --> 13:13.540
Hey, take this,

13:14.100 --> 13:15.540
and take care of yourself.
